#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:8
msgid "获取源码并准备当前任务"
msgstr "Retrieve source and prepare the current task"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:10
msgid ""
"先选择要使用的平台提交。发布包从其 manifest 读取身份；阅读网站时使用 source 链接或 `documentation-"
"build.json` 的提交。开发检出也可以明确选择一个提交并记录 它；版本号与分支名不能代替精确源码身份。"
msgstr ""
"First select the platform commit to consume. A release package supplies "
"identity through its manifest. When reading the site, use its source link or"
" the commit in `documentation-build.json`. A development checkout may also "
"explicitly select and record a commit. Version strings and branch names do "
"not replace exact source identity."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:14
msgid "获取平台与可选示例"
msgstr "Retrieve the platform and optional examples"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:16
msgid "需要 Git 和网络；以下命令只取源码，不准备全部子模块："
msgstr ""
"Git and network access are required. These commands retrieve source only; "
"they do not prepare all submodules:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:29
msgid ""
"检查实际 HEAD 与所选提交一致。首次应用可另取公开的 [nexus-examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus-examples)固定提交；创建独立模板 只需其模板文件与清单，不要求先构建整个例库。"
msgstr ""
"Check that actual HEAD matches the selected commit. For a first application,"
" also obtain a fixed commit of the public [nexus-"
"examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples) repository. Creating "
"an independent template requires only template files and their manifest, not"
" a prior build of the entire examples repository."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:33
msgid "准备所选依赖"
msgstr "Prepare selected dependencies"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:35
msgid "从平台根按任务选择一个入口："
msgstr "From the platform root, select one entry point for the task:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "当前任务"
msgstr "Current task"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "准备方式"
msgstr "Preparation method"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "最小 F407 裸机"
msgstr "Minimal F407 baremetal"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "`prepare --scope preset --preset stm32-qiming-baremetal`"
msgstr "`prepare --scope preset --preset stm32-qiming-baremetal`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "外部应用的 TOML"
msgstr "External application TOML"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "`prepare --scope assembly --assembly /absolute/path/assembly.toml`"
msgstr "`prepare --scope assembly --assembly /absolute/path/assembly.toml`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "Native 外部应用"
msgstr "External Native application"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "上一条明确增加 `--test-support`"
msgstr "Explicitly add `--test-support` to the preceding command"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "平台维护的完整 Native 测试"
msgstr "Complete platform-maintenance Native tests"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "`prepare --scope native`"
msgstr "`prepare --scope native`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "导出源码包"
msgstr "Export a source package"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "按[SDK 发布](../development/sdk-publishing.md)选择 package、后端和组件"
msgstr ""
"Select package, backend and components using [SDK "
"publication](../development/sdk-publishing.md)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:45
msgid ""
"完整命令前缀为 `python tools/dev/dev.py`。准备器默认只验证本地输入，首次需要获取 选中依赖时明确加 `--allow-"
"network`。普通配置和构建不隐式下载；未选库存可保持 未初始化。最小 Native 应用的闭包可以为空，不为此初始化所有 SDK 和 "
"GoogleTest。"
msgstr ""
"The full command prefix is `python tools/dev/dev.py`. By default, "
"preparation only verifies local inputs; explicitly add `--allow-network` "
"when selected dependencies need fetching for the first time. Ordinary "
"configuration and builds do not implicitly download anything. Unselected "
"inventory may remain uninitialized. A minimal Native application may have an"
" empty closure; do not initialize every SDK and GoogleTest for it."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:49
msgid ""
"准备需要干净的平台检出。维护者正在升级依赖时，按[依赖维护](../development/dependencies.md) "
"完成明确变更；普通消费者不修改锁来绕过失败。"
msgstr ""
"Preparation requires a clean platform checkout. Maintainers upgrading "
"dependencies follow [dependency maintenance](../development/dependencies.md)"
" to make explicit changes. Ordinary consumers must not edit locks to bypass "
"failures."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:52
msgid "准备工具"
msgstr "Prepare tools"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:54
msgid ""
"消费工程需要 Python 3.11+、CMake 3.31+、Ninja 和对应 C 编译器。ARM 使用平台锁定 的工具链，见 "
"`dependencies/toolchains.lock.json` 与现有安装器帮助。平台贡献者 "
"另按[开发流程](../development/workflow.md)安装格式与提交工具。"
msgstr ""
"Consumer projects need Python 3.11+, CMake 3.31+, Ninja and the relevant C "
"compiler. ARM uses the platform-pinned toolchain; see "
"`dependencies/toolchains.lock.json` and the existing installer help. "
"Platform contributors additionally install format and commit tools through "
"the [development workflow](../development/workflow.md)."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:58
msgid ""
"使用安装 Source SDK 时保留整个 prefix，直接按[消费指南](use-source-sdk.md)验证 和使用；不把 SDK "
"当成带全部子模块的完整维护检出。"
msgstr ""
"For an installed Source SDK, retain the whole prefix and follow the "
"[consumer guide](use-source-sdk.md) to verify and use it. Do not treat it as"
" a complete maintenance checkout containing every submodule."
